WEBVTT

00:36.980 --> 00:37.840
I'm exhausted.

00:38.150 --> 00:39.680
I truly can't walk anymore.

00:39.700 --> 00:40.310
How about

00:40.820 --> 00:42.220
we stop and rest for a bit?

00:46.460 --> 00:47.690
-Don't stop.
-Don't stop.

00:47.690 --> 00:49.340
If you rest here at the Yin-Yang Crossing,

00:49.340 --> 00:50.820
-you're as good as dead.
-You're as good as dead.

00:50.820 --> 00:51.750
Don't stop.

00:52.180 --> 00:53.580
If you rest here at the Yin-Yang Crossing,

00:53.580 --> 00:54.840
you're as good as dead.

00:55.100 --> 00:56.760
Got it. I'm walking, aren't I?

00:57.460 --> 00:58.950
If you rest here at the Yin-Yang Crossing,

00:58.950 --> 01:00.430
-you're as good as dead.
-You're as good as dead.

01:00.430 --> 01:01.340
-Don't stop.
-Don't stop.

01:01.340 --> 01:03.260
If you rest here at the Yin-Yang Crossing,

01:03.260 --> 01:04.750
-you're as good as dead.
-You're as good as dead.

01:04.750 --> 01:05.670
Don't stop.

01:05.670 --> 01:08.390
-If you rest here...
-If you rest here...

01:09.340 --> 01:10.600
You're as good as dead.

01:22.220 --> 01:26.020
Whispers echo in the forest,
each cry like weeping.

01:26.460 --> 01:30.870
Mimicking human speech,
it drains away vitality.

01:30.870 --> 01:34.750
Old things return,
shifting within the heart.

01:35.150 --> 01:39.310
Not their rightful owner—
calamity will not cease.

02:10.550 --> 02:11.340
Master,

02:12.180 --> 02:14.220
the Spirit Willow with Five Echoing Voices

02:14.220 --> 02:15.150
is a dead end.

02:16.460 --> 02:17.460
He's back.

02:18.460 --> 02:19.220
Who?

02:20.190 --> 02:21.720
The source of all calamity.

02:31.829 --> 02:33.520
[You Have My Heart]

02:33.560 --> 02:34.940
[Episode 1: The Half-Hearted Fated One]

02:45.660 --> 02:47.380
Take care on your way out, miss.

02:47.380 --> 02:47.870
Okay.

02:49.110 --> 02:50.180
Come this way.

02:50.430 --> 02:50.900
Sir,

02:51.310 --> 02:52.840
one basket of buns, please.

02:56.780 --> 02:58.150
Careful.

03:02.060 --> 03:03.430
Where did this pop out?

03:08.940 --> 03:10.200
You're being naughty.

03:11.830 --> 03:14.590
You've been hanging
around the boundary for days.

03:14.590 --> 03:16.060
and you still don't dare to go in?

03:16.060 --> 03:17.720
Oh no, my appointment decree!

03:18.340 --> 03:19.030
What—

03:19.310 --> 03:20.870
are you afraid Lady Fufeng

03:21.150 --> 03:21.660
will

03:21.990 --> 03:23.780
drain your blood and marrow?

03:22.480 --> 03:24.870
[Imperial Appointment Decree
for the Magistrate of Yin-Yang Crossing]

03:23.780 --> 03:25.440
Good thing nothing happened.

03:25.620 --> 03:28.020
It clearly states
in my appointment letter

03:28.340 --> 03:30.140
that my term hasn't started yet.

03:30.660 --> 03:31.500
I just

03:31.790 --> 03:33.230
came here early

03:33.260 --> 03:34.460
to take a look around.

03:34.590 --> 03:35.860
Once I officially take up my post,

03:35.860 --> 03:38.260
I'll be able to administer
Yin-Yang Crossing properly.

03:38.260 --> 03:40.060
This place, Yin-Yang Crossing,

03:40.380 --> 03:42.440
has long been forgotten by the world.

03:42.460 --> 03:43.220
You are

03:43.220 --> 03:44.340
just unlucky

03:44.550 --> 03:45.990
to have been sent here.

03:46.270 --> 03:47.800
The county magistrate here

03:47.829 --> 03:49.910
is nothing more than a figurehead.

03:50.579 --> 03:53.040
The one who truly keeps things
under control

03:53.550 --> 03:54.990
is Lady Fufeng—

03:55.940 --> 03:58.940
that great demon
who has guarded Yin-Yang Crossing

03:59.110 --> 04:01.140
for a thousand years.

04:01.700 --> 04:02.580
A great demon?

04:02.750 --> 04:03.620
Young sir,

04:04.230 --> 04:05.620
take my advice.

04:05.700 --> 04:07.110
Once your term is up,

04:07.580 --> 04:08.380
just leave.

04:09.230 --> 04:10.690
That way you'll stay safe.

04:11.550 --> 04:13.410
T-Thank you for the warning, sir.

04:13.430 --> 04:14.670
But I don't believe

04:14.670 --> 04:16.230
in ghosts or gods.

04:16.750 --> 04:18.610
There are no demons in this world—

04:18.670 --> 04:20.140
only petty men

04:20.310 --> 04:22.240
using tricks to hold their ground.

04:22.470 --> 04:23.620
I'm just trying to earn a living.

04:23.620 --> 04:26.020
It's not like they can
really eat me, right?

04:38.230 --> 04:39.670
You're so naughty.

04:40.310 --> 04:43.110
Grandpa, his feet are huge.

04:47.830 --> 04:50.700
[Yin-Yang Crossing]

04:49.990 --> 04:51.670
It's not like this is the first time
I've had bad luck.

04:51.670 --> 04:53.880
I'll deal with it
if I run into trouble again.

04:53.880 --> 04:59.890
[Yin-Yang Crossing Boundary]

05:55.580 --> 05:57.260
As the wind stills,
souls return,

05:57.260 --> 05:59.190
and willows return to their roots—

05:59.670 --> 06:00.260
gather!

06:03.140 --> 06:04.940
The ground must be purified too.

06:05.380 --> 06:07.640
But there isn't enough spiritual water.

06:10.150 --> 06:10.950
Yes, Master.

06:44.350 --> 06:45.140
Who is it?

06:49.790 --> 06:51.140
This is a murder scene.

06:51.380 --> 06:53.140
The officials haven't arrived yet.

06:53.140 --> 06:55.310
Every blade of grass here is evidence—

06:55.550 --> 06:57.230
how dare you behave so recklessly!

06:57.230 --> 06:58.560
Who do you think you are?

06:58.940 --> 07:01.940
How dare you disturb
Lady Fufeng's corruption purge?

07:02.180 --> 07:03.110
Lady Fufeng...

07:04.700 --> 07:05.430
Lady Fufeng,

07:06.260 --> 07:08.110
this was all a misunderstanding.

07:08.110 --> 07:10.670
I am the newly appointed magistrate
of Yin-Yang Crossing,

07:10.670 --> 07:11.470
Bai Shanjun.

07:15.500 --> 07:16.560
What's happening…

07:17.470 --> 07:18.430
my heart…

07:36.430 --> 07:37.230
Bai Han,

07:38.260 --> 07:40.409
I swear I will kill you in this life

07:40.980 --> 07:42.580
and take back the tree heart!

07:43.310 --> 07:44.500
I swear it—

07:45.140 --> 07:46.350
undying

07:46.990 --> 07:48.020
and immortal.

07:51.250 --> 07:53.450
You actually had the nerve to come back?

07:56.960 --> 07:58.020
Wait—wait! Wait!

08:06.790 --> 08:07.960
You're actually

08:08.480 --> 08:09.880
still alive.

08:16.870 --> 08:17.540
Master.

08:24.840 --> 08:25.810
This man

08:25.840 --> 08:27.100
has been in prolonged contact
with corpses.

08:27.100 --> 08:28.860
Corruption has already entered his heart.

08:28.860 --> 08:30.620
Take him immediately
to the Xiqianhua Mansion

08:30.620 --> 08:32.130
for soul purification and cleansing,

08:32.130 --> 08:33.789
to prevent greater calamity.

08:33.919 --> 08:34.770
No, My Lady!

08:34.799 --> 08:35.299
Take him away!

08:35.299 --> 08:36.630
My Lady. My Lady. My Lady!

08:36.630 --> 08:37.330
My Lady,

08:37.350 --> 08:38.850
I meant no offense just now.

08:38.850 --> 08:41.250
Please, for the sake
of the imperial court…

08:44.190 --> 08:45.660
The Xiqianhua Mansion

08:46.500 --> 08:48.620
is Lady Fufeng's residence.

08:48.070 --> 08:50.290
[Xiqianhua Mansion]

08:50.390 --> 08:51.590
Nine times out of ten,

08:51.830 --> 08:53.990
people who go in never come out.

08:55.190 --> 08:56.350
People from outside

08:56.660 --> 08:59.260
call it the Demon Nest.

09:00.920 --> 09:03.130
Yet the people of Yin-Yang Crossing

09:03.160 --> 09:06.310
offer incense prayers there
during festivals,

09:06.380 --> 09:08.950
calling it the Demon Magistrate Office.

09:09.390 --> 09:10.910
Why?

09:11.070 --> 09:13.230
Because deep beneath Yin-Yang Crossing

09:13.230 --> 09:15.750
lies a tainted substance known
as corruption.

09:15.750 --> 09:19.380
Like miasma,
it erodes everything it touches,

09:19.380 --> 09:22.110
driving people into madness
and loss of control.

09:22.670 --> 09:26.630
Only Lady Fufeng
can keep it under control.

09:26.850 --> 09:28.820
No one else can handle it.

09:39.020 --> 09:39.830
My Lady.

09:40.430 --> 09:41.280
Who are you?

09:41.700 --> 09:43.610
I am the newly appointed magistrate
of Yin-Yang Crossing,

09:43.610 --> 09:44.490
Bai Shanjun!

09:56.900 --> 09:57.950
Lady Fufeng.

09:59.500 --> 10:01.030
It's just the two of us here.

10:01.620 --> 10:02.830
Still pretending?

10:03.020 --> 10:03.620
I...

10:05.110 --> 10:06.550
I didn't pretend anything!

10:06.550 --> 10:08.590
Yin-Yang Crossing
is a semi-autonomous region.

10:08.590 --> 10:10.620
I've been sent by the court
to carry out supervisory duties here.

10:10.620 --> 10:12.140
I'm just doing my duty in return

10:12.140 --> 10:13.400
for the emperor's pay.

10:13.830 --> 10:15.990
If you dislike me,

10:16.260 --> 10:17.870
I can move elsewhere.

10:20.750 --> 10:22.300
What a bureaucratic tone.

10:23.020 --> 10:23.620
What is it—

10:24.350 --> 10:26.010
are you tired of being a demon,

10:26.110 --> 10:28.170
so you switched to being an official?

10:28.470 --> 10:29.590
Or are you

10:29.900 --> 10:31.100
just tired of living,

10:31.540 --> 10:33.020
and finally remember

10:33.260 --> 10:35.540
to return what you took from me—

10:35.540 --> 10:37.900
with interest?

10:38.260 --> 10:38.830
My Lady,

10:39.120 --> 10:40.790
there are no demons in this world.

10:40.790 --> 10:42.900
And I have never
borrowed anything from you.

10:42.900 --> 10:43.370
This...

10:43.390 --> 10:45.230
This is our first meeting.

10:45.840 --> 10:47.840
You are still pretending to be dumb.

10:55.360 --> 10:56.410
I said it before—

10:56.880 --> 10:58.880
I will kill you in this life

10:58.900 --> 11:00.500
and carve out the tree heart.

11:25.950 --> 11:26.590
Master.

11:27.830 --> 11:29.520
It's okay. Lock him up.

11:30.380 --> 11:31.710
No one may approach him

11:32.460 --> 11:33.820
without my permission.

11:36.540 --> 11:37.660
My heart…

11:38.230 --> 11:39.830
Why doesn't it recognize me…

11:40.000 --> 11:41.400
Why is it protecting him?

12:03.110 --> 12:03.710
Master,

12:04.390 --> 12:05.520
I've looked into it.

12:05.990 --> 12:07.030
He is nothing but a mortal,

12:07.030 --> 12:08.080
flesh and blood.

12:08.410 --> 12:10.900
Apart from the anomaly in his chest,

12:11.340 --> 12:15.000
there is no trace of demonic
or spiritual power in his entire body.

12:15.380 --> 12:18.070
But his face is exactly the same.

12:18.910 --> 12:20.840
And the heart beating in his chest…

12:21.030 --> 12:22.550
is indeed half of mine.

12:23.590 --> 12:25.520
Is that really just a coincidence?

12:26.830 --> 12:27.620
Fengling,

12:28.500 --> 12:30.070
I don't have much time left.

12:31.190 --> 12:33.650
If I don't retrieve
the other half of my heart

12:33.950 --> 12:35.880
before the spiritual pool runs dry

12:36.810 --> 12:38.380
and restore my origin...

12:38.900 --> 12:40.360
Then what are we waiting for?

12:40.360 --> 12:41.440
If we already know
something is wrong with him,

12:41.440 --> 12:42.370
use severe interrogation.

12:42.370 --> 12:43.600
I don't believe he won't talk.

12:43.600 --> 12:45.670
We will find a way
to take the heart out of him.

12:45.670 --> 12:46.540
Who knows

12:46.940 --> 12:48.580
if he's testing me,

12:48.680 --> 12:49.600
provoking me,

12:49.850 --> 12:50.850
forcing me to act,

12:51.500 --> 12:53.950
just to seize the other half of my heart?

12:55.070 --> 12:55.660
Then…

12:56.480 --> 12:57.480
what should we do?

13:01.530 --> 13:04.360
He says he is a county magistrate?

13:05.660 --> 13:08.180
That matches the report
from the tea stall at the boundary.

13:07.580 --> 13:08.490
[Imperial Appointment Decree]

13:22.900 --> 13:23.830
A coffin?

13:24.780 --> 13:25.710
I'm still alive!

13:25.830 --> 13:26.750
Let me out!

13:38.990 --> 13:39.720
Where am I...

13:46.230 --> 13:47.140
Let me out!

14:01.140 --> 14:03.670
I'll probably end up
like you two soon enough.

14:05.430 --> 14:08.180
I can't just die like this,
in confusion and injustice.

14:08.180 --> 14:10.040
With my life and death uncertain,

14:10.140 --> 14:11.500
I might as well help you.

14:19.770 --> 14:20.810
Male deceased,

14:21.300 --> 14:23.030
approximately in his forties.

14:25.450 --> 14:26.540
Pupils dilated,

14:28.190 --> 14:29.790
blood from the nasal cavity—

14:32.180 --> 14:33.840
likely death by convulsions.

14:34.540 --> 14:36.470
The workmanship is quite precise.

14:36.900 --> 14:38.590
He doesn't seem like a magistrate—

14:38.590 --> 14:39.750
more like a coroner.

14:42.930 --> 14:44.130
What pattern is this?

14:45.840 --> 14:47.570
Could it be some kind of poison?

14:49.750 --> 14:50.870
A thin-bladed knife.

14:50.870 --> 14:52.730
Is this what you were looking for?

14:56.210 --> 14:56.970
My Lady...

14:56.990 --> 14:59.440
why do you walk without a sound?

14:59.780 --> 15:01.240
You react quickly enough—

15:01.990 --> 15:04.280
pity it was just a backward dodge.

15:13.780 --> 15:15.640
Still able to investigate a case?

15:15.870 --> 15:18.300
You've got some courage,
I'll give you that.

15:18.300 --> 15:20.020
I had nothing else to do,

15:20.110 --> 15:22.380
so I just did something on hand
to calm my mind.

15:22.380 --> 15:24.910
Earlier, I acted
too aggressively toward you

15:24.950 --> 15:26.950
while carrying out the corruption purge.

15:26.950 --> 15:28.260
I apologize for any offense.

15:28.260 --> 15:28.870
My Lady,

15:28.870 --> 15:29.470
I understand

15:29.470 --> 15:30.800
this place is entirely
under your control.

15:30.800 --> 15:32.200
I'm only here in name.

15:32.230 --> 15:33.140
Once my term is up,

15:33.140 --> 15:34.160
I will leave immediately

15:34.160 --> 15:36.220
and never interfere with your rules.

15:36.470 --> 15:37.580
Continue the autopsy.

15:37.580 --> 15:40.840
If you can determine
the cause of death of these two bodies,

15:41.200 --> 15:43.060
you may leave Xiqianhua Mansion.

15:43.380 --> 15:44.910
If you fail to determine it,

15:44.930 --> 15:46.100
then you shall

15:46.340 --> 15:49.190
carve out your heart and give it to me.

15:50.950 --> 15:51.550
My Lady...

15:51.660 --> 15:52.540
This...

15:52.700 --> 15:55.170
Solving a case shouldn't cost my life.

15:55.390 --> 15:56.540
Can I just refuse?

15:56.900 --> 15:57.590
This

15:57.980 --> 15:59.490
is my rule.

16:08.830 --> 16:10.030
Fine, I'll do it then.

16:11.550 --> 16:13.280
My Lady, please keep your word.

16:13.350 --> 16:14.380
If I solve it,

16:14.380 --> 16:15.910
you'll let me leave, right?

16:47.910 --> 16:48.700
No poison...

16:54.100 --> 16:54.900
My Lady,

16:55.470 --> 16:57.940
there are no visible external injuries
on this body.

16:57.940 --> 16:58.870
Pupils dilated—

16:58.910 --> 17:00.270
likely death by convulsions.

17:00.270 --> 17:01.150
The other body

17:01.360 --> 17:04.119
shows obvious external crushing injuries.

17:04.490 --> 17:06.359
It should be
that the horses were startled

17:06.359 --> 17:07.300
and trampled him to death

17:07.300 --> 17:08.430
while running wild.

17:09.540 --> 17:10.390
Then...

17:10.410 --> 17:11.619
what is this?

17:21.670 --> 17:23.839
Just the oil paper
used to wrap sesame cakes.

17:23.839 --> 17:24.970
How do you know that?

17:25.690 --> 17:27.950
This man still had undigested sesame cake
in his stomach.

17:27.950 --> 17:29.910
There were
also sesame cake crumbs and grease

17:29.910 --> 17:30.820
under his fingernails—

17:30.820 --> 17:31.990
all of which match.

17:32.590 --> 17:34.940
The paper is just decorated
in a gaudy way;

17:36.300 --> 17:37.500
it doesn't seem
to hide anything suspicious.

17:37.500 --> 17:39.990
Then what about the spiderweb-like marks

17:40.260 --> 17:41.190
on their chests?

17:41.300 --> 17:42.500
That...

17:42.750 --> 17:43.950
I can't figure it out.

17:43.980 --> 17:45.870
None of the

17:45.890 --> 17:47.290
toxicology, pathology,

17:47.290 --> 17:48.310
or common injury patterns I know

17:48.310 --> 17:49.440
match this.

17:49.850 --> 17:50.570
My Lady,

17:50.600 --> 17:51.940
I request to return to the scene
for further inspection.

17:51.940 --> 17:52.620
No need.

17:53.190 --> 17:54.390
You misjudged it.

17:55.030 --> 17:56.680
Indeed, this is oil paper used
to wrap sesame cakes—

17:56.680 --> 17:59.390
but the pattern on it
is a corruption-inducing talisman.

17:59.390 --> 18:00.750
Anyone who carries it

18:01.020 --> 18:02.820
will be affected by corruption.

18:02.950 --> 18:06.610
These two were killed after their minds
were disrupted by corruption.

18:06.610 --> 18:08.010
The marks on their chests

18:08.060 --> 18:09.060
were not caused by poison—

18:09.060 --> 18:10.400
they are burn marks left by corruption.

18:10.400 --> 18:12.070
I only believe in what I can see

18:12.100 --> 18:13.390
and what I can verify.

18:13.860 --> 18:17.340
You're calling this
a corruption-inducing talisman?

18:17.420 --> 18:19.520
Don't tell me you're using superstition

18:19.520 --> 18:21.120
as evidence in a murder case?

18:23.500 --> 18:25.090
I've just arrived in Yin-Yang Crossing—

18:25.090 --> 18:27.960
My Lady, are you trying
to sentence me to death?

18:30.580 --> 18:31.390
Yes.

18:38.150 --> 18:38.950
Fine.

18:39.260 --> 18:40.520
If that's your ruling,

18:42.000 --> 18:42.930
I accept defeat.

18:43.520 --> 18:44.360
But My Lady,

18:44.610 --> 18:46.090
I have one last request.

18:46.670 --> 18:47.300
Speak.

18:47.820 --> 18:50.150
Can I at least
have something to eat first?

19:20.930 --> 19:22.930
I need to find a way to get out of here.

19:58.340 --> 20:00.470
If you die with lingering resentment,

20:01.020 --> 20:03.350
come back as a vengeful spirit
and find me.

20:08.650 --> 20:10.050
Death puts out the light.

20:10.680 --> 20:12.960
Maybe this is my fate—

20:13.820 --> 20:15.150
just bad luck I deserve.

20:44.260 --> 20:45.150
Don't come any closer!
